OL,3,AMeghan's father Thomas Markle appears
OL,4,Ain court after arrest on charge
OL,5,Arelating to child sex abuse material
OL,6,
OL,7,FThomas Markle, the father of Meghan,
OL,8,FDuchess of Sussex, has appeared in
OL,9,Fcourt after being charged over the
OL,10,Fpossession of child sex abuse material
OL,12,FMarkle was arrested in Florida this
OL,13,Fmorning after the FBI searched two Los
OL,14,FAngeles-area storage units he rented
OL,15,Ffor almost 20 years - here's more from
OL,16,Fthe Department of Justice statement
OL,18,FImages published by news outlets
OL,19,Falongside reports of the 82-year-old's
OL,20,Farrest appear to show him in handcuffs
OL,21,Fsurrounded by FBI personnel
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
