OL,3,AMeghan's father Thomas Markle appears
OL,4,Ain court after arrest on charge
OL,5,Arelating to child sex abuse material
OL,6,
OL,7,FMarkle has previously denied
OL,8,Fallegations of possessing images of
OL,9,Fchild sex abuse, calling the claims
OL,10,F"sick lies"
OL,12,FThe duchess has been estranged from her
OL,13,Ffather since 2018 - in a statement last
OL,14,Fmonth, the wife of Prince Harry said:
OL,15,F"I am deeply distressed... my thoughts
OL,16,Fare with any children who may have been
OL,17,Fharmed"
OL,19,FShe added that she hoped it could be
OL,20,Funderstood why she had largely cut off
OL,21,Fcontact from her father
